# Project Architecture Rules

This project is a Multi-Asset AI Scanner + ML Probability Engine + Risk-Gated Execution Bot + Admin GUI.

The architecture is:

- Cursor/GitHub: code development and source control
- trading-engine/: Python FastAPI backend
- base44-app/: Admin GUI and control plane only
- IBKR/TWS or IB Gateway: broker connection
- AWS/VPS: production backend hosting
- PostgreSQL: persistent trade/config/log storage
- Redis: queue/cache/background jobs

Hard boundary:

Base44 must never execute trades directly.
Base44 must never store broker credentials.
Base44 must never connect directly to IBKR/TWS.
Base44 is only the UI/control plane.

The Python backend is responsible for:
- scanner
- ML probability model
- Greeks computation
- Fibonacci risk engine
- risk gate
- PDT guard
- margin guard
- execution engine
- IBKR/TWS connection
- trade journal
- audit logs

Default mode must be:
- live trading disabled
- paper trading enabled
- manual approval required
